' CI1 mechanism-proof + scope-gate fixture (DISTINCT name from the real registry so a
' mis-keyed registry row is visible). A minimal attach-only focusable with a `sub init()`
' that binds a BARE LOCAL (`startColor`) — used by the scope-binding gate test (a valid
' requiresInScope name resolves; a bogus one hard-fails). No onKeyEvent.
sub init()
    startColor = m.global.COLORS.WHITE
    m.label = m.top.findNode("label")
    m.color = startColor
    m.scale = 1.1
end sub

sub handleFocus(evt as dynamic)
